{
 "id": "seg3b",
 "title": "断在哪一关 · Binance",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 71.41,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3b-00",
   "text": "最后一起，也是最大的一起。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.976,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.733
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-01",
   "text": "2026 年 10 月 29 日，Binance 多条链的热钱包，被转走约 63.4 亿美元。这是项目方的口径。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.796,
   "dur": 8.064,
   "speechStart": 4.894,
   "speechEnd": 12.01
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-02",
   "text": "按项目方的初步报告，攻击者先用一份假的面试作业，控制了一名工程师的电脑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-02.mp3",
   "start": 13.08,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 13.178,
   "speechEnd": 18.916
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-03",
   "text": "另一名工程师的电脑上，放着容器部署的令牌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.972,
   "dur": 4.368,
   "speechStart": 20.07,
   "speechEnd": 23.486
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-04",
   "text": "攻击者用它部署了自己的容器，接触到了内部签名服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-04.mp3",
   "start": 24.56,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 24.658,
   "speechEnd": 28.634
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-05",
   "text": "这是第五关。攻击者没有偷钥匙，他让签名服务替他签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-05.mp3",
   "start": 29.7,
   "dur": 5.496,
   "speechStart": 29.798,
   "speechEnd": 34.355
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-06",
   "text": "签出来的，是 50 笔操纵 nonce、设置 EIP-7702 委托的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-06.mp3",
   "start": 35.416,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 35.514,
   "speechEnd": 40.978
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-07",
   "text": "以太坊热钱包的地址，从此会执行攻击者指定的代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-07.mp3",
   "start": 42.044,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 42.142,
   "speechEnd": 45.892
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-08",
   "text": "然后是第七关。Binance 暂停了提现，关掉了热钱包服务。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-08.mp3",
   "start": 46.944,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 47.042,
   "speechEnd": 51.801
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-09",
   "text": "但委托是链上状态，不受这些开关控制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-09.mp3",
   "start": 52.876,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 52.974,
   "speechEnd": 56.033
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-10",
   "text": "按公开的时间，这个委托在链上存活了大约 3 小时 50 分钟。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-10.mp3",
   "start": 57.104,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 57.202,
   "speechEnd": 61.535
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3b-11",
   "text": "告警时间、内部 AI 工具怎么被利用，报告里还没有说清。完整报告还在等。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep29/audio/lines/seg3b-11.mp3",
   "start": 62.604,
   "dur": 7.608,
   "speechStart": 62.702,
   "speechEnd": 69.39
  }
 ],
